<Layout 
    title="Sports Injury Rehabilitation in Faridabad | Neriva Health" 
    description="Advanced sports physiotherapy for ACL tears, sprains, and athletic injuries in Sector 45, Faridabad. Return to sport safely with Dr. Abhishek Kumar."
>
    <section class="section-padding" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary-blue);">Sports Injury Rehabilitation</h1>
            <p style="font-size: 1.125rem; color: var(--text-light); max-width: 800px; line-height: 1.8; margin-bottom: 3rem;">
                From professional athletes to weekend warriors, sports injuries require specialized care. We offer advanced sports physiotherapy to help you recover faster, regain strength, and return to your sport safely.
            </p>

