                    <li><strong>Advanced Modalities:</strong> Cupping, taping, and manual therapy to accelerate healing.</li>
                    <li><strong>Biomechanical Assessment:</strong> Identifying movement faults that led to the injury.</li>
                    <li><strong>Return-to-Sport Protocols:</strong> Sport-specific drills to ensure you are ready to compete.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

